.saivage/stages/cycle-021-implement-selection-delete-command-kernel-boundary/reports/t1-implement-selection-delete-boundary.json:6:  "summary": "Implemented the Cycle 021 decision-selected direct path. Added a narrow frontend/src/application/selectionDeletion/SelectionDeletionCommandService and SelectionDeletionCommandPort, wired it in AppShellRuntime, and refactored SelectionUseCases so it no longer imports or constructs Command, CommandStack, or DeletionSequenceFactory and no longer performs inline commit/push choreography. Added focused unit coverage for service lifecycle semantics, SelectionUseCases success/failure/no-op behavior, and boundary assertions, plus credential-free keyboard e2e coverage for create/select/Ctrl+A/Escape/Delete/undo/redo. Captured pre/post/final scoped status/static scans, mandatory lint/Vitest/build/e2e logs, refreshed the live preview on 0.0.0.0:5173, and documented files changed, deletes/proofs, validation index, protected-surface checks, and residual risks in architecture-audit/cycle-021-selection-delete-command-kernel-boundary/implementation-log.md. All required validation gates passed in stable logs.",
.saivage/stages/cycle-021-implement-selection-delete-command-kernel-boundary/reports/t1-implement-selection-delete-boundary.json:27:      "item": "SelectionUseCases no longer imports/constructs Command or DeletionSequenceFactory or performs inline command-stack deletion choreography.",
